The files in src/math/ are TypeScript ports of FDLIBM 5.3 (Freely Distributable LIBM): exp, expm1, log, sin, cos, tan, sinh,
cosh and tanh (with the FreeBSD msun revision of tanh, which keeps the same notice), the argument reduction modulo pi/2 and
their bit-level helpers (word access, scalbn, abs, sign, min, max), which come from the same earlier port. The FDLIBM sources
